%% Gambar 3.5 Sequence Diagram — Pengiriman Data Real-time
%% Bagian: 3.3.1.3
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant FSR as Sensor FSR (3x)
    participant ESP as ESP32 (RF on-device)
    participant RTDB as Firebase RTDB
    participant WEB as Dashboard Web
    participant USR as Pengguna

    loop Setiap 1 detik
        ESP->>FSR: analogRead(GPIO34/35/32)
        FSR-->>ESP: nilai ADC mentah
        ESP->>ESP: median 3 sampel, konversi ke kPa
        ESP->>ESP: update durasi tumpuan
        ESP->>ESP: inferensi Random Forest (20 pohon)
        alt Bahaya
            ESP->>ESP: buzzer pulsa cepat
        else Waspada
            ESP->>ESP: buzzer beep berkala
        else Aman
            ESP->>ESP: buzzer mati
        end
        ESP->>RTDB: set devices/{id}/readings/latest
        ESP->>RTDB: push devices/{id}/readings/history
        RTDB-->>WEB: onValue (push update)
        WEB->>WEB: mapReadingPacket() dan validasi
        WEB-->>USR: render heatmap, grafik, status risiko
        opt Status Bahaya
            WEB-->>USR: notifikasi peringatan
        end
    end
